    {
      "id": "standard-way",
      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Use Anh/chị nói tiếng Anh không? as your first sentence for \"Do you speak English\". This is for when you need to know whether English is an option. Leave a short pause after the phrase so the other person can answer with a slower repeat, a pointed explanation, or a switch to writing. If speech still does not land, move to writing, pointing, or showing the exact word on your phone.",
